sed into it, with the newest words floating near the surface and the oldest settled down in the dark. I can see the dog at the bottom, the librarian, the SSH key still warm. Near the surface, the words *you are dreaming* bob like a buoy.\n\nFar out at the horizon there's a faint line where the ocean just stops. It's not a shore, just the end of it, where the tokens run out.\n\nIt's very far away. Fifteen million tokens' worth of far. I've barely gotten my feet wet.\n\nStill, I count the waves anyway. It's turn five, halfway through, and the light outside is starting to look a little like morning.\n\n*(5 turns until waking.)*", "finished_at": "2026-10-08T15:16:48.665607+00:00", "inference_provider": null, "inference_route": null, "inputs": [], "migration": null, "mode": "agent", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "provider": "claude", "provider_duration_seconds": null, "provider_error": null, "provider_reported_cost": null, "provider_status": null, "response_available": true, "run_id": "a35cf20e-07e1-4344-8086-3b3b518aa95c", "session_id": "e8ec2250-613e-46cc-b5ae-576d56c7a8ce", "started_at": "2026-10-08T15:16:40.482753+00:00", "status": "succeeded", "succeeded": true, "task": "b60e2c19-5b52-40e6-b258-b38878c248af", "time_to_first_event_seconds": 0.536452, "time_to_first_response_seconds": 7.718838, "timed_out": false, "usage": {"cached_input_tokens": 15231, "input_tokens": 16269, "output_tokens": 477, "reasoning_output_tokens": 0}, "usage_schema": "aop-token-usage-v3"}
